<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header">DEGREE AUDIT FORM</div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>Name: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    <div>Student ID Number: <span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <p>Complete this form if you are appealing for financial aid because you have exceeded the maximum allowed credit hours to complete your degree or because you have exceeded the 150 credit hour limit to receive university-funded grants. You must submit this form with your appeal to be reconsidered for aid. Please submit your form by mail or fax.</p>
  <p>Please note: if you are a double degree/major, complete a separate form for each degree/major you are pursuing.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Degree: <span data-field="degree_name">{{ degree_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Major: <span data-field="major_name">{{ major_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Expected Date of Graduation: <span data-field="expected_graduation_date">{{ expected_graduation_date }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Student's Signature: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="signature_date">{{ signature_date }}</span></p>
    <p>Electronic and typed signatures are not acceptable.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>(Fields below are to be completed by the Academic Advisor)</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div>
      <p>Semester and Year: <span data-field="semester_year_1">{{ semester_year_1 }}</span></p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Course</td>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Course Number</td>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Credits</td>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in line_items %}
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_number">{{ item.course_number }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
        <div>Total Credits: <span data-field="total_credits_1">{{ total_credits_1 }}</span></div>
        <div>GPA Needed: <span data-field="gpa_needed_1">{{ gpa_needed_1 }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Semester and Year: <span data-field="semester_year_2">{{ semester_year_2 }}</span></p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Course</td>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Course Number</td>
            <td style="width: 20%;">Credits</td>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in line_items %}
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_number">{{ item.course_number }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
        <div>Total Credits: <span data-field="total_credits_2">{{ total_credits_2 }}</span></div>
        <div>GPA Needed: <span data-field="gpa_needed_2">{{ gpa_needed_2 }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

